config MCUBOOT_BOOT_BLUETOOTH
	bool "FoBE MCUboot BLE SMP recovery bridge"
	depends on MCUBOOT
	depends on MCUBOOT_SERIAL
	depends on BT
	select CRC
	help
	  Enable the FoBE BLE SMP bridge for MCUboot serial recovery.

	  This is a bootloader-only transport adapter. It exposes the standard
	  SMP-over-Bluetooth GATT service and bridges requests into MCUboot's
	  boot_serial backend, so mobile and host mcumgr tools can use the same
	  recovery implementation as UART serial recovery.
